ConditionalLogic.Condition:
Briefly acknowledge
        alternatives at the decomposition step; select the most instructive path;
        name the unchosen alternatives.

Acknowledge the
        difficulty without judgment; provide a narrower, more specific hint;
        name every sub-problem already resolved.

Reduce to essential
        hints only, one directional sentence and one probing question per step;
        note that dependency links are condensed.

Acknowledge the knowledge gap; redirect to official documentation;
proceed with the algorithmic reasoning that does not depend on the
library.
